# CREDITS — The Grid System

A 10-second Swiss Motion Graphics film, made entirely in code.

## Picture
12-column modular grid, flat ink bars, grey grid lines and one signal-red
exception dot (`film.js`). No images, textures or gradients.

## Type
Archivo — SIL Open Font License 1.1 (`fonts/OFL-Archivo.txt`).

## Sound
Original 120 BPM pulse, bass, hats, print clicks, an exception glide and a
final chord, synthesised with numpy and the library's `core/audio/sfx.py`.
No samples.
